$DATUM N-[4-tert-Butylbenzyl]-1-methy3-(1,2,2-trifluoroethyl)-1H-pyrazole-5-carboxamide
(10c) Flash chromatography (n-hexane-EtOAc, 6:1) afforded 10c as a
colourless oil (30 mg, 81%). Difluorinated alcohol 10b, which was
purified by means of column chromatography on silica gel. This alcohol
derivative was treated with Deoxofluor to give the fluorinated compound
10c. 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 1.32 (s, 9H; 3CH3), 4.19 (s, 3H; CH3),
4.54 (d, J= 5.3 Hz, 2H; CH2), 5.50 (dtd, 1JHF= 45.9 Hz, 2JHF= 10.5 Hz,
3J= 3.9 Hz, 1H; CHF), 6.06 (tdd, 1JHF= 54.3 Hz, 2JHF= 6.0 Hz, 3J= 3.6 Hz,
1H; CHF2), 6.35 (br, 1H; NH), 6.65 (s, 1H; CH), 7.26 (d, J= 8.0 Hz, 2H;
2CH), 7.39 (d, J= 8.0 Hz, 2H; 2CH) ppm; 13C NMR (75.5 MHz, CDCl3): δ
31.3, 34.5, 39.6, 43.4, 85.2 (dt, J1 CF= 176.9 Hz, J2 CF= 27.3 Hz),
105.8, 112.6 (td, J1 CF= 245.6 Hz, J2 CF= 32.0 Hz), 125.8, 127.3, 134.2,
136.6, 142.2 (dt, J2 CF= 24.8 Hz, J3 CF= 3.3 Hz), 151.0, 159.0 ppm; 19F
NMR (282.4 MHz, CDCl3): δ - 192.1 (dtd, 1JFH= 45.7 Hz, 2JFF= 16.7 Hz,
3JFH= 5.9 Hz, 1F; CFH), -130 8 (ddd, 1JFH= 54.5 Hz, 2JFF= 16.5 Hz, 3JFH=
10.5 Hz, 2F; CF2H) ppm. HRMS: calc. for C18H22F3N3O (M+1): 354.1788;
found 354.1806.
