$DATUM Fluorination of betulinines and other triterpenoids with DAST
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Biedermann, David; Sarek, Jan; Klinot, Jiri; Hajduch, Marian; Dzubak,
Petr
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthesis (2005), (7), 1157-1163

