David R.; Clayton, Simon; La Flamme, Francois; Mirmehrabi, Mahmoud;
Tadayon, Sam; Tovell, David; Couturier, Michel
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2010), 75(10), 3401-3411

